{"id":"e935f19ab5bcebb3","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-erdos-partition.md","title":"Erdős Partition","display":"thm-erdos-partition — Erdős Partition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-erdos-partition","aliases":["58-thm-erdos-partition"],"display":"thm-erdos-partition — Erdős Partition","depends_on":["[[58-df-partition]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-weakly-compact]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-erdos-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-erdos-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-erdos-partition — Erdős Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"58-df-partition\">58-df-partition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abfb943ceddb6090\" href=\"?note=abfb943ceddb6090\" title=\"58-df-weakly-compact\">58-df-weakly-compact</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (weakly compact cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S\\)</span> (weak-compactness predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}partition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\n\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}partition}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\n\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The partition arrow has been expanded into its coloring quantifier, homogeneous subset and cardinality requirement.  For uncountable cardinals this property characterizes weak compactness; strong inaccessibility alone does not imply it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-partition","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-partition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-weakly-compact","status":"resolved","id":"abfb943ceddb6090","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-weakly-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}partition}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\to\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\n\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1162,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-erdos-partition.md|58-thm-erdos-partition]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["ebc39f41721b42e4","5fb1c2241d1943d1","abfb943ceddb6090","36d7463d215be751"]}